{
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Filename:       sensor.temp_rh.shtc3.spin2
    Description:    Driver for the Sensirion SHT-C3 Temperature/RH sensor
    Author:         Jesse Burt
    Started:        Jul 27, 2020
    Updated:        May 3, 2025
    Copyright (c) 2025 - See end of file for terms of use.
